    "NELL:What is a transit mark?": "nell-b50847039d0ae643.mp3",
    "ORIN:Two fixed marks. Line them up and you know where you're looking. Much less opinionated than a sailor.": "orin-bc49a24d15e96a8f.mp3",
    "NELL:Which way should the water run?": "nell-83829420e1a8ed3b.mp3",
    "ORIN:Depends on the tide and the channel. Use the board at the landing. Don't mistake one swirl for a conspiracy.": "orin-c425fa38fcc757fd.mp3",
    "NELL:Will you come with me?": "nell-99504533e1777c41.mp3",
    "ORIN:Find out whether the bridge is admitting pedestrians today. I'll keep an eye on the water from here.": "orin-94b4aca70371a5d4.mp3",
