    "NELL:Still six inches. Still a frontier.": "nell-4088efa80e6f0d58.mp3",
    "QUIBBLE:Halt! Captain Quibble owns this bridge. Passage costs three bruises to my ego.": "quibble-bd9a8014fd215706.mp3",
