    "NELL:A practice blade, thoughtfully blunted. Only pride gets hurt here.": "nell-2236047db8d6c0a0.mp3",
    "FINE PRINT:Expenses: ink, crackers, ink-flavoured crackers. These accounts are private, unlike this allegedly public bridge.": "fine-print-95851416ef133ada.mp3",
    "QUIBBLE:You've won. I still insist on the last word.": "quibble-3ed8abd83c0c0733.mp3",
    "NELL:Then make it welcome. You keep the word. I keep walking.": "nell-da55168f025a980f.mp3",
