    "NELL:I came looking for a job. I appear to have found a question. Tomorrow, I'll find out who else is asking it.": "nell-ade3933629cba409.mp3",
    "NELL:A company boat knew when the current would turn.": "nell-3bc52a30722b982a.mp3",
